    {
      "id": "dxa9RUwu2Uki7Y7Ge1sTJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1222.2463471223546,
      "y": -135.75776518586937,
      "width": 531.0796508789062,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 292383653,
      "version": 514,
      "versionNonce": 2134048101,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785860595802,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> S is the speech signal (matrix of speech samples)\n-> x is the mapped symbol..mapped from the encoder\n-> w is the noise\n-> s cap is the recovered signal from the decoder\n-> ph(y|x) is the physical channel that takes input\nsignal and transmits the output as y\n-> Speech Encoder and Channel Encoder is implemented\nby an independent NN\n-> alpha is parameter of the encoder\n-> beta is the parameter of the decoder",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> S is the speech signal (matrix of speech samples)\n-> x is the mapped symbol..mapped from the encoder\n-> w is the noise\n-> s cap is the recovered signal from the decoder\n-> ph(y|x) is the physical channel that takes input\nsignal and transmits the output as y\n-> Speech Encoder and Channel Encoder is implemented\nby an independent NN\n-> alpha is parameter of the encoder\n-> beta is the parameter of the decoder",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8ZH9BfJUbN2mFL6H7myFZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1192.3257641286032,
      "y": 216.56199562734628,
      "width": 469.6396789550781,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2078460747,
      "version": 482,
      "versionNonce": 1990335589,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785860955594,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "X is the mapped output of the following\n1. speech is encoded by the speech encoder SE.\n2. that encoded speech is again encoded by the\nchannel encoder CE.\n\nSE has the parameter alpha \nCE has the parameter beta\nafter the symbols are mapped it is transmitted \nover the phhysical channel",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "X is the mapped output of the following\n1. speech is encoded by the speech encoder SE.\n2. that encoded speech is again encoded by the\nchannel encoder CE.\n\nSE has the parameter alpha \nCE has the parameter beta\nafter the symbols are mapped it is transmitted \nover the phhysical channel",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9MZOiw0Sg0BAcpfYjLkxO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1208.7137343249499,
      "y": 481.66221231207,
      "width": 431.73968505859375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1277405029,
      "version": 7,
      "versionNonce": 287971237,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785861571423,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "when x is transmitted from the transmitter \nto receiver it is \ntransmitted at an average power of 1",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "when x is transmitted from the transmitter \nto receiver it is \ntransmitted at an average power of 1",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "p6npZ4NmydlJAdgRvRKec",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1224.0384762990616,
      "y": 712.7925842875077,
      "width": 415.8396911621094,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1223432869,
      "version": 213,
      "versionNonce": 66901061,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785861990972,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> h is the cofficient of the channel\nwhich typicall distorts the signal\n-> h is usually complex. its magnitude gives\nattenuation and phase gives delay\n-> For AWGN h = 1, \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> h is the cofficient of the channel\nwhich typicall distorts the signal\n-> h is usually complex. its magnitude gives\nattenuation and phase gives delay\n-> For AWGN h = 1, \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rDBTQjTaRk1BL0nSsFQbl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1236.8447335456453,
      "y": 894.5036333076746,
      "width": 420.7596740722656,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 723525899,
      "version": 70,
      "versionNonce": 1624607845,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785863148114,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "w is additive noise\nCN — circularly symmetric complex Gaussian\nmean of noise = 0\nσ^2I — the covariance.\nSNR = 1/σ^2\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "w is additive noise\nCN — circularly symmetric complex Gaussian\nmean of noise = 0\nσ^2I — the covariance.\nSNR = 1/σ^2\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "z69SRsfYMYnWBjCddOhsD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1151.534422942475,
      "y": 1148.2383195339562,
      "width": 472.7996826171875,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 60156011,
      "version": 568,
      "versionNonce": 997056549,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785863659138,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "s cap is the mapped output of the following\n1. speech is decoded by the speech decoder SD.\n2. that decoded speech is again decoded by the\nchannel decoder CD.\n\nSD has the parameter delta \nCD has the parameter chi\nreceived signal y",
      "fontSize": 20,
